{
  "file" : "npc/jobs/2-2/dancer.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Sonotora",
      "text" : "[Athena Sonotora]\nThey say the\nfamous dance school\nhere in Comodo is going\nto open soon."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Sonotora",
      "text" : "[Athena Sonotora]\nAah...\nTo be a prima donna\nin the spotlight!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Sonotora",
      "text" : "[Athena Sonotora]\nI want to sign up too,\nbut the requirements are\nso specific. I wonder if\nI should just try anyways..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "[Bor Robin]\nAah....\nA prima donna\nin the spotlight!\nI'll be able to watch them become Dancers right before my eyes...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "[Bor Robin]\nIt's great to be\na man in this day and age! Hurray for the Comodo Theater!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "[Bor Robin]\nMm?\nYou want\nto go, too?\nIt's a good opportunity to watch the Dancer job change test."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "Go to the Job Change Area"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "[Bor Robin]\nYaay~~\nLet's go!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Bor Robin",
      "text" : "[Bor Robin]\nHuh...\nWell, I can't\nhelp it if you don't\nwant to accompany me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nOne two three four,\nTwo two three four,\nthree four, three four,\none two three four.\nUm?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nI'm sorry, but you're interrupting my practice by looking at me funny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\n.......\n.....Hey, haven't I seen you before?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nErr...\nThat's weird, I can't remember where I've seen you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWelcome~!\nLet me know\nif you have any new songs. We can always use some new music to complement our performances."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWelcome~!\nHow are you\nthese days?\nDo many people enjoy\nyour performances?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWelco--Mmm?\nHey, only authorized personnel can come here. Not just anyone can enter the Dance School."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nIf you want to watch, why don't you go to the Dance Stage in town?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWelcome~!\nThis is the\n'Comodo Dance School,'\nwhere we teach various dances from different countries. We provide entertainement for travelers from all over the world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWe also provide the opportunity for aspiring Dancers to become famous throughout the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom! Doesn't dancing in the spotlight sound spectacular?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nI think it's fair to let you know that our school is selective. So we don't accept students who don't seem to have the talent to become Dancers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWhat do you think?\nDo you want to sign up? You only have to write a couple of things on the application, and you can just come to the lessons once or twice and try it out."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nSo what do\nyou want to do~?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "Fill out the application."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "I'll pass."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nGood choice!!\nJust fill out the application right there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "...\n......"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "^3355FF*Shuffle Shuffle*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[Aile]\nYour name is\n{0}?\nWow! What a pretty name! Just a moment, I have to show this to the director, so come back in a little bit, okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nMmm...\nIt seems that\nyou aren't quite qualified to enroll in our school yet. You need to be at least Job Level 40."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWell, I hope\nthat you apply\nagain when you meet\nthe requirements."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nAww~\nJust think about it.\nDon't forget to come back\nif you change your mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWelco--Mmm?\nHey, this place is only for authorized personnel. If you want to sing, you should go look into being a Bard."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nNot all Archers\ncan become Dancers.\nAt least, not without some sort of sex change~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nGood.\nSince you signed up earlier, I'll let you know some things you'll need to bring for your lessons."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWe're short on some supplies, but you'll be using them for yourself anyway. Just think of it as part of the tuition, so don't worry too much."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nFirst, there's the tuition fee of ^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000. Then, you'll about ^CD688920 Sticky Mucus^000000 for shoe polish."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nThen, bring ^CD68893 Jellopy^000000 and ^CD68895 Red Potions^000000 to use as ointment. And of course, you'll need a pair of ^CD6889Shoes^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nOnce again, that's\n^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000,\n^CD688920 Sticky Mucus^000000,\n^CD68893 Jellopy^000000,\n^CD68895 Red Potions^000000 and\n^CD68891 Shoes^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nFirst, there's the tuition fee of ^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000. Then, bring ^CD68895 Earthworm Peelings^000000 for polishing the floor and, of course, a pair of ^CD6889Boots^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nOnce again that's\n^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000,\n^CD68895 Earthworm Peelings^000000 and \n^CD68891 Boots^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nFirst, there's the tuition fee of ^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000. Then, bring ^CD68892 Clam Shells^000000 for your costume, ^CD68895 Yellow Potions^000000 and ^CD688920 Jellopy^000000 to treat foot injuries."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nYou'll also need to bring ^CD688910 Black Hairs^000000 to make wigs for the performances and, of course, a pair of ^CD6889Sandals^000000. Once again, that's..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\n^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000,\n^CD68892 Clam Shells^000000,\n^CD68895 Yellow Potions^000000,\n^CD688920 Jellopy^000000,\n^CD688910 Black Hairs^000000 and\n^CD6889Sandals^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nOnce you've gathered everything that you need, come back so that we can begin the lessons, okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nOh...!\nYou brought\neverything!\nAlright then,\nlet me take your\ntuition fee."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nNext, go to ^CD6889Bijou^000000, who is in charge of the interviewing process. She will have a couple of things she'll need to ask you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nMmm...?\nYou don't have\neverything yet?\nLet me remind you\nso you can bring\nwhat you need next time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nBring...\n^CD688910,000 Zeny^000000,"
    },
    {
