    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nHmm...?\nAre you having\ntrouble finding\n^CD6889Bijou^000000?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nYou need to talk to her because she's in charge of the interviewing process. Don't worry, she should be somewhere here in the Dance School."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nI'll be looking\nforward to a great\nperformance~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 399,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nWelcom--Hm?\nHey, only authorized\npersonnel are allowed\nin here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Aile",
      "text" : "[Aile]\nIf you want to watch, be quiet and don't disturb the performers. Everyone here is busy practicing so that they can become fine Dancers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 415,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nYou can't change jobs\nif you still have skill\npoints left. Use the rest\nand come back later."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 424,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nWelcome~\nOoh, a Bard! Do you have any new songs to show us? We can always use some musical accompaniment for our dances."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 430,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOh my...!\nWelcome back~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 434,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nHow are you\nthese days?\nA lot of people\nmust love watching\nyou dance. Are you\nenjoying the spotlight?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 443,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOh dear~\nYou seem to have traveled quite a distance to watch me perform."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 447,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nI'm sorry, but I've retired. Now I'm focusing on training new Dancers. If you go to the Center Stage, you can watch my students~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 452,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOh my~\nYou want to\nbecome a Dancer,\ndon't you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 458,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nI know you're excited, but the first step is the application. Go over to the left side of the stage where Aile can help you with that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 464,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOh my~\nYou want to\nbecome a Dancer,\ndon't you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 470,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nG-goodness!\nLook at that stomach fat!\nWell, it's not much, so you'll lose it in no time. Especially since I'll be handling your training~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 475,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nStill...\nThe idea of the\nperfect body sure\nhas changed since\nI was young. Anyway..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 482,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nLet's start\nwith the interview.\nI'm only going to ask\na couple of simple things\nso don't worry~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 489,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOkay...\nLet's begin."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 495,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOh, you're back~\nHave you studied\nsome more? Try to\npass this time, okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 504,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n1. The Dancer's dance, ^CD6889Lady Luck^000000,\nincreases which of the following?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Intelligence (INT)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Dexterity (DEX)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Vitality (VIT)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Critical Attack Rate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 510,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n2. Of the following,\nwhich can you not consider\nto be a dance?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Tango"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Tap Dance"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "HIP-HOP"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Hip Shaker"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Lightning Bolt"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 523,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n3. Which of the following\nbest describes a Dancer?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 527,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Person who yells."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 527,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "A loud person."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 527,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "A person who dances."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 527,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "A person who sings."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 529,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n4. Which of the following\ncannot be associated with Comodo?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
