      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "A lot of Thieves."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 535,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n5. Before Comodo, what is the region name of the region NorthEast of Pharoah's Lighthouse Island?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 538,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
