    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 546,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n...\nThat's...\n^660000completely wrong^000000.\nDidn't you see the\nother choices?!\nMinus points...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 562,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\n7. Of the following,\nwho can perform together\nwith a Dancer?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 567,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Assassin"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 567,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
