      "placeholders" : [
        ".@da_score"
      ],
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nLet's see...\nYour score is\n{0} points..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 775,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Very well done!\nA perfect score!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 778,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nThere aren't too many people who apply for the Dancer job with this kind of knowledge. I'm sorry for judging you by your looks~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 781,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nWhew~\nNow you only have the Dance Test. While we prepare the test, why don't you rest a bit? Ho ho ho~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 788,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "It wasn't perfect, but I'll let you pass."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 793,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "You.. You failed!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 795,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nWas it too hard?\nWhen I was young, everyone knew at least enough to pass this test. Go and study some more before coming back, okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 802,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOkay...\nAre you ready\nfor the Dance Test?\nIf you like, I can\nexplain the instructions."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 809,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Listen to instructions."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 809,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "Go to the testing area."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 810,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nFirst of all, each person gets ^CD68891 minute^000000 for the test, and everyone dances ^CD6889one at a time^000000. Don't worry if you've never danced before~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 813,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOnce you enter the testing area, you will see the stage. First, ^CD6889change your camera angle so that it faces forward^000000. It will probably work if you ^CD6889double-click on the right mouse button^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 816,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nIf you don't reset your camera angle, you may get the ^CD6889Up, Down, Left, Right^000000 commands confused."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 819,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nWait for your turn in the ^CD6889waiting room^000000. If the person in front of you fails, or if it's your turn in line, your test will begin."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 822,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nIf there are a lot of people, not everyone might fit in the waiting room. If that's the case, just create an orderly line~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 825,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nWhen the test begins, the music will be broadcast, as well as the direction in which you should move. Just follow the instructions and move your legs."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 828,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nRemember, ^CD6889you will be disqualified if you don't perform the steps with the right timing^000000. Be careful, the test is very strict~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 832,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nWell then~\nGood luck...!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 842,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nOh my...\nDid you\nfail last time?\nDon't worry, just\ntry to feel the rhythm~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 854,
      "npc" : "Bijou",
      "text" : "[Bijou]\nYou can't change jobs\nif you still have skill\npoints left. Use the rest\nand come back later."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 861,
